अमत्र अमत्र, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. अम्), Ved. over-
powering, overcoming, strong, violent, impetuous;
(अम्), n., Ved. strength, power; a vessel, a utensil.

अमानुष अ-मानुष, अस्, ई, अम्, not human,
anything but man; supernatural, inhuman, a monster;
not well disposed towards man.

आमय, अस्, m. damage, hurt; disease, sickness;
indigestion; (अम्), n., N. of the medical plant Cos-
tus Speciosus.
